    <assignments>
        <description>Sets the idempotency flag on the triggering Opportunity record in memory, ahead of the Update Triggering Record element.</description>
        <name>Set_Handoff_Tasks_Created</name>
        <label>Set Handoff Tasks Created</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Record.Handoff_Tasks_Created__c</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Update_Triggering_Opportunity</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <decisions>
        <description>Short-circuits the flow when any ACC Base Utilities kill switch covering this automation is active: the global master switch, the Opportunity object switch, or this flow&#39;s own named-automation switch.</description>
        <name>Is_Kill_Switch_Active</name>
        <label>Is Kill Switch Active?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Kill Switch Active</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>All_Kill_Switches_Clear</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Setup.Global_Kill_Switch__c.Disable_All__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Setup.Object_Kill_Switch__c.Disable_Opportunity__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Setup.Automation_Kill_Switch__c.Disable_Warm_Handoff_Action_Plan__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Is_Partner_Record_Type</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>All Kill Switches Clear</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>Only Partner Opportunities apply the Warm Handoff Action Plan. Checked here (not as a Start filter) because a RecordType.DeveloperName Start filter crashes at runtime in this org.</description>
        <name>Is_Partner_Record_Type</name>
        <label>Is Partner Record Type?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Not Partner Record Type</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Is_Partner</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.DeveloperName</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Partner</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Warm_Handoff_Template</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Is Partner</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>Guards against a missing or unpublished Formal Warm Handoff template version so the flow no-ops instead of erroring.</description>
        <name>Is_Template_Version_Found</name>
        <label>Is Template Version Found?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No Template Version Found</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Template_Version_Found</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Warm_Handoff_Template_Version.Id</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Create_Warm_Handoff_Action_Plan</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Template Version Found</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>When a Partner Opportunity&#39;s stage changes to MOU Signed, applies the Formal Warm Handoff Action Plan Template to the Opportunity&#39;s Account, generating the handoff checklist Tasks assigned to the Opportunity Owner. Guarded by Handoff_Tasks_Created__c so a re-save never duplicates the checklist. Checks the Global, Object (Opportunity), and Automation (Warm Handoff Action Plan) kill switches from ACC Base Utilities before doing any work. Every DML/lookup step has a fault path to ErrorLogger.logFromFlow (ACC Base Utilities Log Error action). NOTE: the Record Type check is done via a Decision on $Record.RecordType.DeveloperName rather than a Start filter, because a RecordType.DeveloperName cross-object Start filter deploys and activates cleanly but throws an unhandled runtime exception on every trigger in this org.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Opportunity - On Edit - Apply Warm Handoff Action Plan {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Opportunity - On Edit - Apply Warm Handoff Action Plan</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
        <description>Creates the ActionPlan against the Opportunity&#39;s Account using the Formal Warm Handoff template version. RecordCreationType=Autocreated causes the platform to immediately generate the ten checklist Tasks from the template items, owned by the Opportunity Owner.</description>
        <name>Create_Warm_Handoff_Action_Plan</name>
        <label>Create Warm Handoff Action Plan</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Set_Handoff_Tasks_Created</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <faultConnector>
            <targetReference>Log_Error_Create_Warm_Handoff_Action_Plan</targetReference>
        </faultConnector>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>ActionPlanTemplateVersionId</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Get_Warm_Handoff_Template_Version.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>ActionPlanType</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Industries</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Name</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Formal Warm Handoff</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>OwnerId</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.OwnerId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>RecordCreationType</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Autocreated</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>StartDate</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Flow.CurrentDate</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>TargetId</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.AccountId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>ActionPlan</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordLookups>
        <description>Gets the Formal Warm Handoff Action Plan Template by its admin-editable UniqueName, so the template content can change without touching this flow.</description>
        <name>Get_Warm_Handoff_Template</name>
        <label>Get Warm Handoff Template</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Warm_Handoff_Template_Version</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <faultConnector>
            <targetReference>Log_Error_Get_Warm_Handoff_Template</targetReference>
        </faultConnector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>UniqueName</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Formal_Warm_Handoff</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>ActionPlanTemplate</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <description>Gets the Final (activated) version of the Formal Warm Handoff template.</description>
        <name>Get_Warm_Handoff_Template_Version</name>
        <label>Get Warm Handoff Template Version</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Is_Template_Version_Found</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <faultConnector>
            <targetReference>Log_Error_Get_Warm_Handoff_Template_Version</targetReference>
        </faultConnector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>ActionPlanTemplateId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Get_Warm_Handoff_Template.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Status</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Final</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>ActionPlanTemplateVersion</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordUpdates>
        <description>Marks the triggering Opportunity so a later re-save into MOU Signed never creates a second Action Plan.</description>
        <name>Update_Triggering_Opportunity</name>
        <label>Update Triggering Opportunity</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <faultConnector>
            <targetReference>Log_Error_Update_Triggering_Opportunity</targetReference>
        </faultConnector>
        <inputReference>$Record</inputReference>
    </recordUpdates>
    <start>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Is_Kill_Switch_Active</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>StageName</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>MOU Signed</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Handoff_Tasks_Created__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
</Flow>
